  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28514001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "您好……这……是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28514003",
              "text": "送给柔嘉的专属礼物。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28514003",
              "text": "是柔嘉的房子，和家。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28514002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28514003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "这样贵重的礼物……真的……真的要浪费在我身上吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28514004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "我……我这样的人……怎么能够……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28514005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "柔嘉想要一直陪伴在我身边吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28514006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "……嗯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28514007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那就必须收下它，这就是陪伴必须要承担的「后果」哦？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28514008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "还有，不可以再说「浪费」和「我这样的人」这种话了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28514009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "是……对不起……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28514011",
              "text": "也不可以随便道歉。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28514010",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28514011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "嗯……是。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28514012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "现在柔嘉有什么感想要说吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28514013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "|101|是世上最温柔的人了，温柔……又很强大。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28514014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "柔嘉也是世上最温柔的女孩子，温柔、漂亮又强大。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28514015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "我……我还有一个愿望……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28514017",
              "text": "嗯？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28514016",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28514017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "我希望……|101|能交到更多，比我更好的朋友。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28514018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "以后每一天，都要比现在更快乐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
